{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpi",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Findings",
                  "field": "finding_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_table_occurrence",
                      "params": {
                        "reason": "",
                        "ddr": ""
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Not used anywhere",
                  "field": "unused_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_table_occurrence",
                      "params": {
                        "reason": "unused"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Dead branch",
                  "field": "dead_branch_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_table_occurrence",
                      "params": {
                        "reason": "dead_branch"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Dead island",
                  "field": "dead_island_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_table_occurrence",
                      "params": {
                        "reason": "dead_island"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Without DDR info",
                  "field": "low_confidence_count",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "unused_table_occurrence",
                      "params": {
                        "ddr": "without"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Affected files",
                  "field": "affected_files",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Unused Table Occurrence",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file, name or reason…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_name",
                  "label": "Name",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "base_table",
                  "label": "Base table",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "reason_status",
                  "label": "Reason",
                  "nowrap": true,
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "unused": "Not used anywhere",
                    "dead_branch": "Dead branch",
                    "dead_island": "Dead island",
                    "unused_unverified": "Not used anywhere (unverified)",
                    "dead_branch_unverified": "Dead branch (unverified)",
                    "dead_island_unverified": "Dead island (unverified)"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "anchor_to",
                  "label": "Attached to",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "branch_size",
                  "label": "Dead group size",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "low_confidence",
                  "label": "Without DDR info",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "Yes",
                    "false": "No"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "TableOccurrence",
                  "file": "{{file_name}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No unused table occurrence found."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "What the reasons mean"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Not used anywhere.** No layout, portal, formula, script step, layout field, value list, lookup or privilege set refers to the table occurrence, and it has no relationship. It can be deleted on its own.\n\n**Dead branch.** The table occurrence is used only as a side of relationships, and nothing beyond it is used. *Attached to* names the used table occurrence the branch hangs on; *Dead group size* counts the table occurrences of the branch — they can be deleted together.\n\n**Dead island.** No table occurrence of its relationship group is used. The whole group can be deleted; *Dead group size* counts it.\n\n**Never a finding.** A table occurrence on the path between two used ones — typically the join table occurrence of an n:m relationship — is needed even when nothing refers to it directly. The same holds for both sides of a relationship that deletes related records.\n\n**Without DDR info.** The file was exported without DDR info. Formula references `Table::Field` are then recognized only in the formula text, and evaluation contexts are missing — a usage can stay invisible. Such a finding reads *unverified* (e.g. *Dead branch (unverified)*); the tile *Without DDR info* lists them. Export the file again with DDR info before deleting anything.\n\n**Limits.** Only usage inside the imported solution counts. Not visible: **access from outside** — OData, ODBC/JDBC, Data API, files that were not imported; **dynamic references inside** — `GetField`, `Evaluate`, names inside SQL strings. A finding is a review candidate, not a delete recommendation. [How usage is counted](/docs/fm-lab/schema/schema%2FUsage%20and%20References)"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
